From 75894887d7272df71c2c263feb4ea0b6d211fd48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mladen Kolar <mkolar@usc.edu>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:02:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate coordinate descent to pure PB block proximal oracles

Use prox_block for scalar CD and Newton calls, compute generic group results in model buffers before public iterate writes, and route specialized group lasso updates through the shared PB kernels. Preserve KKT skips, zero-curvature branches and cache updates. Pin PB 8fb174454a5b0c431376decf5a3c87830353a562 and cover extreme finite shrinkage.
